<section id="school-faqs" class="sugi-card sugi-editor" data-sugi-knowledge-editor data-endpoint="/admin/assistant/knowledge"><header class="sugi-card-heading"><div><h2>School FAQs</h2><p>Add reviewed school facts so Sugi can answer students in the right workspace.</p></div></header><p class="sugi-notice">Only institutional information: no student records or private cases. FAQs follow your workspace’s access policy; guests can read them if the workspace is public. Publishing confirms your school reviewed the facts and translations.</p><noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to edit school FAQs. Published answers remain available on the Help page.</p></noscript><p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-faq-status>Loading the current draft…</p><div class="sugi-editor-actions"><button type="button" class="workspace-button" data-faq-add disabled>Add FAQ</button><button type="button" class="workspace-button" data-faq-reload>Load latest draft</button><button type="button" class="workspace-button" data-faq-save disabled>Save draft</button></div><div data-faq-entries></div><div class="sugi-publish-bar"><label><input type="checkbox" data-faq-reviewed disabled/> I confirm these facts and all three translations have been reviewed by the school.</label><button type="button" class="workspace-button" data-faq-publish disabled>Publish reviewed FAQs</button></div><details><summary>Publication history</summary><p>Published snapshots are retained. Saving a draft does not change students’ answers.</p><ol data-faq-history></ol></details></section>
